# VektorFlow 15xr

Connect your store. 7-day trial. AI agents automate your e-commerce.

## Features

- OAuth-only login (connect your store)
- 7-day free trial
- Universal LLM support (BYOK)
- CJ Dropshipping integration
- Autonomous AI agents
- Subscription enforcement

## Deploy

1. Fork this repo to GitHub
2. Connect to Render
3. Add environment variables
4. Deploy

